### Extension VS Code : "REST Client" (humao.rest-client)
@host = http://localhost:3000

### 1. Inscription (agent par défaut)
POST {{host}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{ "nom": "Ahmed", "email": "ahmed@sangconnect.tn", "password": "Password123" }

### 2. Inscription ADMIN (pour tester les rôles)
POST {{host}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{ "nom": "Admin", "email": "admin@sangconnect.tn", "password": "Password123", "role": "ADMIN" }

### 3. Login (copiez le token)
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "ahmed@sangconnect.tn", "password": "Password123" }

### 4. Sans token -> 401
GET {{host}}/api/dons

### 5. Avec token -> 200 (remplacez VOTRE_TOKEN)
GET {{host}}/api/dons
Authorization: Bearer VOTRE_TOKEN

### 6. Moi
GET {{host}}/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer VOTRE_TOKEN

### 7. Mauvais rôle (agent) -> 403
DELETE {{host}}/api/users/1
Authorization: Bearer VOTRE_TOKEN

### 8. Créer un don (ADMIN, AGENT_CENTRE) / Modifier le stock (ADMIN, RESPONSABLE_STOCK)
POST {{host}}/api/dons
Authorization: Bearer VOTRE_TOKEN

###
PUT {{host}}/api/stock
Authorization: Bearer VOTRE_TOKEN
